For a Clone type, Owned is the type itself
   <i32 as ToOwned>::Owned      = i32
   <String as ToOwned>::Owned   = alloc::string::String
   <Vec<u8> as ToOwned>::Owned  = alloc::vec::Vec<u8>

Checkpoint. What is 42_i32.to_owned()? Is (&ticket).to_owned() a new ticket?
   42_i32.to_owned() -> i32 42
   a.to_owned() is the same address as a: true   (it is a &Ticket, seat 12)

Derive Clone, and the same call on the same kind of reference copies the value
   b.to_owned() is the same address as b: false   (it is a Seat, seat 12)
